rial | Implementation | RHOAI Pipelines | P0 |\n| RHAISTRAT-9019-E005 | Document tutorial gallery usage and the tutorial contribution process | Implementation | RHOAI Docs | P1 |\n\nPriority derivation:\n- E002 is P0 (HLR-1 is P0).\n- E003/E004 are P0 (HLR-2 is P0).\n- E001 maps to HLR-3 (P1) but transitively enables the P0 gallery (HLR-1) and\n  the P0 tutorials (HLR-2) — priority inheritance raises it to P0.\n- E005 is a `docs-authoring` epic covering HLR-4 (P2); per the docs-authoring\n  priority exception it takes its priority from the strategy frontmatter\n  (`priority: Major` → P1), not from HLR-4 or from inheritance.\n\n## Dependency DAG\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    E001[RHAISTRAT-9019-E001 packaging format] --> E002[RHAISTRAT-9019-E002 gallery + launch]\n    E001 --> E003[RHAISTRAT-9019-E003 notebook tutorials]\n    E001 --> E004[RHAISTRAT-9019-E004 pipeline tutorial]\n    E002 --> E005[RHAISTRAT-9019-E005 documentation]\n    E003 --> E005\n    E004 --> E005\n```\n\nCritical path: E001 → E002 (or E003/E004) → E005, length 3.\n\n## DAG Justification\n\n| Edge | Rule | Rationale |\n|------|------|-----------|\n| E001 → E002 | Rule 13 (build-against artifact) | The gallery code parses tutorial metadata and launch configuration defined by the packaging format — an API/schema artifact the Dashboard implementation builds against, not a configuration reference. |\n| E001 → E003 | Rule 13 (build-against artifact) | Tutorial content is packaged (metadata, pinned images, validation manifest) per the format; authoring cannot complete before the format is defined. |\n| E001 → E004 | Rule 13 (build-against artifact) | Same as above for the pipeline tutorial. |\n| E002 → E005 | Rule 11 (docs-authoring last) | Documentation describes what was built; blocked by every Implementation epic. |\n| E003 → E005 | Rule 11 (docs-authoring last) | Same. |\n| E004 → E005 | Rule 11 (docs-authoring last) | Same. |\n| E002 ∥ E003 ∥ E004 (no edges) | Rule 14/15 parallel + AC gate | The ga