{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8138b7073bdc19d7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9019\n3\tepic_count: 5\n4\tcritical_path_length: 3\n5\tdecompose_complete: true\n6\trevised: false\n7\ttriage: null\n8\ttriage_rationale: null\n9\t---\n10\t# Decomposition Summary — RHAISTRAT-9019 (Curated getting-started tutorial gallery)\n11\t\n12\tTriage: not below-threshold — the strategy spans multiple components (Dashboard,\n13\tNotebooks, Data Science Pipelines, Documentation), multiple teams, and multiple\n14\tarchitecturally distinct work streams (product code for the gallery and launch\n15\tmechanics, authored tutorial content, and documentation), which the problem\n16\tstatement itself calls out as \"three different kinds of work with different\n17\towners and review processes\". Not docs-only — the Dashboard requires code\n18\tchanges. Full decomposition follows.\n19\t\n20\tStrategy structure notes: the strategy provides HLRs and an Affected Components\n21\tlist, but no Impacted Teams table, no Dependencies table, no Given/When/Then\n22\tacceptance criteria, no NFRs, and no Staff Engineer Input (see Health\n23\tWarnings). Open Questions: \"None\" — no Investigation epics are warranted. Team\n24\tassignments are derived from the architecture-context owning teams.\n25\t\n26\t## Epic List\n27\t\n28\t| ID | Title | Type | Team | Priority |\n29\t|----|-------|------|------|----------|\n30\t| RHAISTRAT-9019-E001 | Define the tutorial packaging format (metadata, pinned images, validation manifest) | Implementation | RHOAI Dashboard | P0 |\n31\t| RHAISTRAT-9019-E002 | Dashboard tutorial gallery with one-click launch into the user's project | Implementation | RHOAI Dashboard | P0 |\n32\t| RHAISTRAT-9019-E003 | Author the notebook-based curated tutorials (first workbench, data prep, first training run, first deployment, first RAG app) | Implementation | Workbenches | P0 |\n33\t| RHAISTRAT-9019-E004 | 