eline curated tutorial | Implementation | RHOAI Pipelines | P0 |\n33\t| RHAISTRAT-9019-E005 | Document tutorial gallery usage and the tutorial contribution process | Implementation | RHOAI Docs | P1 |\n34\t\n35\tPriority derivation:\n36\t- E002 is P0 (HLR-1 is P0).\n37\t- E003/E004 are P0 (HLR-2 is P0).\n38\t- E001 maps to HLR-3 (P1) but transitively enables the P0 gallery (HLR-1) and\n39\t  the P0 tutorials (HLR-2) — priority inheritance raises it to P0.\n40\t- E005 is a `docs-authoring` epic covering HLR-4 (P2); per the docs-authoring\n41\t  priority exception it takes its priority from the strategy frontmatter\n42\t  (`priority: Major` → P1), not from HLR-4 or from inheritance.\n43\t\n44\t## Dependency DAG\n45\t\n46\t```mermaid\n47\tgraph TD\n48\t    E001[RHAISTRAT-9019-E001 packaging format] --> E002[RHAISTRAT-9019-E002 gallery + launch]\n49\t    E001 --> E003[RHAISTRAT-9019-E003 notebook tutorials]\n50\t    E001 --> E004[RHAISTRAT-9019-E004 pipeline tutorial]\n51\t    E002 --> E005[RHAISTRAT-9019-E005 documentation]\n52\t    E003 --> E005\n53\t    E004 --> E005\n54\t```\n55\t\n56\tCritical path: E001 → E002 (or E003/E004) → E005, length 3.\n57\t\n58\t## DAG Justification\n59\t\n60\t| Edge | Rule | Rationale |\n61\t|------|------|-----------|\n62\t| E001 → E002 | Rule 13 (build-against artifact) | The gallery code parses tutorial metadata and launch configuration defined by the packaging format — an API/schema artifact the Dashboard implementation builds against, not a configuration reference. |\n63\t| E001 → E003 | Rule 13 (build-against artifact) | Tutorial content is packaged (metadata, pinned images, validation manifest) per the format; authoring cannot complete before the format is defined. |\n64\t| E001 → E004 | Rule 13 (build-against artifact) | Same as above for the pipeline tutorial. |\n65\t| E002 → E005 | Rule 11 (docs-authoring last) | Documentation describes what was built; blocked by every Implementation epic. |\n66\t| E003 → E005 | Rule 11 (docs-authoring last) | Same. |\n67\t| E004 → E005 | Rule 11 (docs-authoring last) | Same. |\n68\t| E002 ∥ E003 ∥ E004 (no edges) | Rule 14/15 parallel + AC gate | The gallery is launch mechanics; the tutorials are content launched through it. They meet at runtime, not at build time: the coupling is expressed as an acceptance criterion on the gallery epic (end-to-end launch of a packaged tutorial succeeds), not as a DAG edge. |\n69\t| E003 ∥ E004 (no edge) | Rule 1 (different component/team) | Notebook tutorials (Notebooks/Workbenches) and the pipeline tutorial (Data Science Pipelines/RHOAI Pipelines) are independent content work in different component areas. |\n70\t\n71\tComponent mapping notes (canonical names from `.context/rhai-components.txt`):\n72\t- E001 spans Dashboard, Notebooks, and Data Science Pipelines consumption; it\n73\t  is assigned canonical component `Dashboard` because the gallery is the\n74\t  primary consumer/renderer of the format and the Dashboard team owns the\n75\t  launch contract. The span is recorded here per the component-name constraint.\n76\t- E005 is assigned canonical component `Documentation` (in the canonical list;\n77\t  no architecture-context file exists for it — see Health Warnings).\n78\t\n79\t## HLR Traceability Matrix\n80\t\n81\t| HLR | Priority | Requirement (abridged) | Epics | Notes |\n82\t|-----|----------|------------------------|-------|-------|\n83\t| HLR-1 | P0 | Tutorial gallery in the Dashboard with launch into the user's project | RHAISTRAT-9019-E002 | Direct cover: gallery surface + workbench/pipeline launch mechanics. |\n84\t| HLR-2 | P0 | Six curated tutorials covering the core journeys, tested against the current release | RHAISTRAT-9019-E003, RHAISTRAT-9019-E004 | Split by component/team boundary: E003 covers the five notebook/workbench journeys (first workbench, data prep, first training run, first deployment, first RAG app); E004 covers the first-pipeline journey (Data Science Pipelines, different owning team). To