ages the tutorial was\n50\t  tested against.\n51\t\n52\t## Acceptance Criteria\n53\t\n54\t- A user can open the tutorial gallery from the Dashboard and see the curated\n55\t  tutorials with their metadata.\n56\t- Launching a notebook-type tutorial opens a workbench in the user's project\n57\t  containing that tutorial's notebook.\n58\t- Launching a pipeline-type tutorial imports that pipeline into the user's\n59\t  project.\n60\t- End-to-end launch of at least one packaged tutorial (one notebook-type and\n61\t  one pipeline-type) succeeds against a current release build — this is the\n62\t  runtime coupling to tutorial content and is verified here as an acceptance\n63\t  gate, not a dependency on the content work.\n64\t- The gallery renders only tutorials whose validation manifest records a pass\n65\t  against the current release.\n66\t\n67\t## HLR Traceability\n68\t\n69\t- HLR-1 (P0): \"The Dashboard has a tutorial gallery from which a user can\n70\t  launch a tutorial into their project (opening a workbench with the notebook,\n71\t  or importing the pipeline).\" Full cover.\n72\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-af6523f3bbe53b4e","agent_id":"a3701fb798c825e88","session_id":"bc2fac71-1701-446f-99e6-c82b84a2c07c","uuid":"51c97d1c-8f1c-4eed-ab3a-b91a1a22ce4c","timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:28:15.545Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-98f6225c1e2c3766","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9019"}
